<messaging:emailTemplate subject="Invoice Approval - {!relatedTo.Account__r.Name}" recipientType="User" relatedToType="KimbleOne__Invoice__c">
<messaging:htmlEmailBody >
    <html>
        <body>
        <p>Please confirm that the following Invoice is correct and is ready to be dispatched to the customer.</p>
        <p>Your approval will result in the item being passed to our Finance department for despatch.</p>
        <p>By rejecting the Invoice it will revert to a Draft state.</p>
        <p>Account: {!relatedTo.Account__r.Name}</p>
        <p>Invoice: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__Reference__c}</p>
        <p>Invoice Date: {!relatedTo.KimbleOne__InvoiceDate__c}</p>
        <p> 
			<apex:outputText value="Net Amount: {0,number,#,###.00}"> 
			    <apex:param value="{!ROUND(relatedTo.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c,2)}" /> 
			</apex:outputText>         
        </p>
        <p>
			<apex:outputText value="Tax Amount: {0,number,#,###.00}"> 
			    <apex:param value="{!ROUND(relatedTo.KimbleOne__TaxAmountSum__c,2)}" /> 
			</apex:outputText>                  
        </p>
        <p>
			<apex:outputText value="Total Amount ({!relatedTo.CurrencyIsoCode}): {0,number,#,###.00}"> 
			    <apex:param value="{!ROUND(relatedTo.KimbleOne__GrossAmount__c,2)}" /> 
			</apex:outputText>        
        </p>
        
        <table border="1" style="margin: 10px; border-width: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; padding: 10px 30px 10px 30px">
            <tr style="color: #FFFFFF; border-width: 1px; padding: 2px; border-style: solid; border-color: #810541; background-color: #B0B0B0;">
	 			<th>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__InvoiceLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__Narrative__c.Label}</th>
	 			<th>{!$ObjectType.KimbleOne__InvoiceLine__c.Fields.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c.Label}</th>
			</tr>
			<apex:repeat value="{!relatedTo.InvoiceLines__r}" var="invLine">
			<tr style="border-width: 1px;padding: 2px;border-style: solid;border-color: #810541;background-color: #FFFFF0;">
				<td>{!invLine.KimbleOne__Narrative__c}</td>
				<td>
					<apex:outputText value="{0, number, {!invLine.CurrencyIsoCode} #,###.00}">
						<apex:param value="{!ROUND(invLine.KimbleOne__NetAmount__c,2)}"></apex:param>
					</apex:outputText>				
				</td>
			</tr>
			</apex:repeat>
			</table>
 
        <p>You can approve or reject this Invoice, by replying to this email and entering either APPROVED or REJECTED in the first line together with any comments in the second line. If you have any queries regarding this confirmation please contact our Operations Department on 0207-876 5432, or operations@kimbleapps.com.</p>
        <br/>
        Regards
        <br/>
        {!$Organization.Name} Operations Department
        </body>
    </html>

</messaging:htmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>